{"4095000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ballistic Brews", "steam_appid": 4095000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5008180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Battle is a Driving Challenge </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a test of driving skill and tactical decision-making. Drift through deadly boss attacks, mow down massive swarms, manage your economy, and brew devastating builds capable of destroying everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Favorite Vehicle </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a lightning-fast samurai mech to a broadside battleship, every vehicle features unique passives, weapon layouts, and build possibilities. Discover wildly different strategies with every vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew the Perfect Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources wisely. Balance immediate power against long-term growth, combine powerful item synergies, and brew game-breaking vehicles capable of surviving the toughest battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Over Grind </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the action immediately. Master vehicle handling, learn powerful build synergies, and conquer increasingly brutal difficulties. Unlock new vehicles, weapons, and items as you improve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot <strong>15 unique vehicles</strong>, each with distinct passives that create entirely different builds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>30+ weapons</strong> across three weapon slots to create devastating combinations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>5 escalating difficulties</strong>, each introducing deadlier enemies, elite variants, and tougher boss encounters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive third-person camera</strong> built for driving—with instant zoom-out whenever you need battlefield awareness. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endgame challenge mode for veteran players. </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>100+ balanced items</strong> designed to encourage experimentation and endless build variety. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced</strong> runs that finish in under 25 minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs great on <strong>Steam Deck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>controller</strong> gaming</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Battle is a Driving Challenge </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app