ing difficulties</strong>, each introducing deadlier enemies, elite variants, and tougher boss encounters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive third-person camera</strong> built for driving—with instant zoom-out whenever you need battlefield awareness. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endgame challenge mode for veteran players. </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>100+ balanced items</strong> designed to encourage experimentation and endless build variety. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced</strong> runs that finish in under 25 minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs great on <strong>Steam Deck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>controller</strong> gaming</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Drive tanks and robots in an immersive roguelike bullet heaven. Drift, shoot, and smash through 15 waves while brewing the ultimate build to defeat brutal bosses and elite enemies.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/e59c598d57cd5113e525dd5d01e78f1a95b8a928/header.jpg?t=1788252369", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/df25937339b57a8b50f799121617b00fe7c4d7c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788252369", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/df25937339b57a8b50f799121617b00fe7c4d7c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788252369", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>